IwHflVv7zAh_UrgdA&oe=6AC50861"}, "display_name": "COLOR FIT Mixed Reality", "keywords": ["fitness", "workout", "boxing", "mixed", "reality"], "long_description": "\nAre you tired of subscription workout apps? then get this one for free.\n\nColor Fit is A mixed reality workout experience that gets your whole body moving. Break boxes using hand tracking while encouraging full-body motion to warm up your muscles. Ideal for morning exercise. The physics-based gameplay makes it surprisingly addictive.\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Room-scale mixed reality \u2013 No motion sickness, no hitting walls, and no tripping over kids or pets.\n\n- Hand tracking \u2013 No controllers, and no excuse for breaking your TV.\n\n- Dynamic shadows on virtual objects \u2013 The cubes feel like they truly exist in your room.\n\n- Full-body movement \u2013 You\u2019ll feel every stretch (and maybe hear a few cracks).\n\n- Built with purpose \u2013 I made this app to help relieve my back pain, hopefully, it helps with yours too.\n\n- Early access \u2013 Expect major updates and improvements over time.\n\nPlease join my discord to shape this app based on your feedback. I need you! https://discord.gg/ZGAHEuA", "short_description": "A mixed reality workout app that gets your whole body moving. Smash boxes using hand tracking and full-body motion to warm up your muscles. Perfect for morning workouts, with addictive physics-driven gameplay."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://frozen-dreams.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Frozen Dreams", "support_website_url": "https://frozen-dreams.com/contact/", "website_url": "https://frozen-dreams.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_co